riginal character. Detailed reference materials are provided in the attached link. There are no specific requirements, so I would be very happy if you could interpret and express the character freely in your own style.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wCRfnJ1qGBsafreiqOtISJIb8JgfOPY4", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pano11/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1b2ba967/uploads/origins/705a8aca-7b7a-4167-a255-4b9367025cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb15a3b6d7b13c642d18b67d9860f834", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1b2ba967/uploads/origins/705a8aca-7b7a-4167-a255-4b9367025cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb15a3b6d7b13c642d18b67d9860f834, https://si.imgix.net/1b2ba967/uploads/origins/705a8aca-7b7a-4167-a255-4b9367025cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c550720f5e01473ad446ebcbfa6e3f1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1b2ba967/uploads/origins/705a8aca-7b7a-4167-a255-4b9367025cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09004049c428ebebff187a7f166bc276 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こもれびさん、はじめまして！\nリクエスト失礼します。うちの子「ユキノ子」の絵をお願いしたいです。\n* 身体特徴として、大きめのケモ耳にオッドアイ、146㎝、14歳頃の体型。\n* 服装について、セーラー服と黒タイツ\n* そして、ポーズ・表情等はお任せいたします。\n\n資料はお手数ですが下記のURLから参照お願いします。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/4M5sUqc", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pano11/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8f377841/uploads/origins/fd704740-29a6-4b2e-9845-34c605745b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59d8948ce3d4798d4fca49171b95bcd9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8f377841/uploads/origins/fd704740-29a6-4b2e-9845-34c605745b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59d8948ce3d4798d4fca49171b95bcd9, https://si.imgix.net/8f377841/uploads/origins/fd704740-29a6-4b2e-9845-34c605745b15?bg=%2